00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,840
“All right, that's fine, I'll do it. No, of course I'm happy.” But where does

2
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:09,640
this come from, if, when you leave that situation, you keep dwelling on it for hours?

3
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:13,080
You keep telling other people, “You won't believe what the other person

4
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:17,400
said to me, what they did to me, or what I'm going to have to do.” Because what

5
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:22,480
was missing in that moment was assertiveness. It was understanding

6
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:26,640
that you could politely say, “No, that doesn't work for me. I don't

7
00:00:26,640 --> 00:00:29,520
think it's fair. Could we do this differently?”
